<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FOCUS-Dutch PTT bid for TNT seen successful.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FOCUS-Dutch PTT bid for TNT seen successful.</headline>
<byline>Bernard Hickey</byline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch telecommunications and postal group Koninklijke PTT Nederland NV (KPN) on Wednesday launched a US$1.6 billion takeover bid for world-wide transport group TNT Ltd, aiming to create Europe's largest fast-post business.</p>
<p>A combined KPN-TNT group would be in the world's top four time-sensitive freight and logistics groups and have annual revenues of over A$6 billion (US$4.4 billion).</p>
</text>
